<title>UK: INSIGHT - Gold to test support at $315-$316.50.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Gold to test support at $315-$316.50.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   319.60/0.10 *  315.00 * 323.00 *    22 * 329.53 * 337.80</p>
<p> SILVER   4.32/4.34 *    4.25 *   4.70 *    28 *   4.58 *   4.70</p>
<p> PLAT   402.50/5.50 *  400.00 * 420.00 *    41 * 416.88 * 422.67</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 9---------------</p>
<p>Gold remained under pressure on Wednesday leading technical analysts to forecast a test of the $315-$316.50 an ounce support area.</p>
<p>A failure there could take gold back to the week's lows around $314.00, they said.</p>
